checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy, checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1 was also unhealthy as v2.3.1-rc in staging. Rolled checkout-api back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback all regions run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is 0.2%. Next step: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 53848, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01ViMv7znurcjLuqr92iVdKt", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53848, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01ViMv7znurcjLuqr92iVdKt", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 57684, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, all three regions run v2.3.0 and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 covers the failure, the rollback and the recovery. It also notes that the cause of the v2.3.1 failure needs to be found before redeploying it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01QCEXSboeFVHgeyCWxEg54i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AXPmupiRbBcDLZh5x5PstD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Mu7jidASJHpPBBNJDnDkSj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017ACieCRufR4qzsfpNGCr2G", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FqLrDBAonRsc48qcncoiNm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ViMv7znurcjLuqr92iVdKt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy, checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an 18% error rate. v2.3.1 was also unhealthy as v2.3.1-rc in staging. Rolled checkout-api back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback all regions run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is 0.2%. Next step: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. After the rollback, all three regions run v2.3.0 and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 covers the failure, the rollback and the recovery. It also notes that the cause of the v2.3.1 failure needs to be found before redeploying it.", "type": "text"}]}]}